<section class="draft-workspace" aria-label="个人草稿">
  <div><strong>我的草稿 <span id="draft-count">0</span> 题</strong><p id="draft-help">点击题目下的“编辑我的草稿”，可写笔记、修改 Java。自动保存在当前浏览器。</p></div>
  <div class="draft-backup-actions"><button type="button" id="draft-export" disabled>导出全部草稿</button><button type="button" id="draft-import">导入备份</button><input type="file" id="draft-file" accept=".json,application/json" hidden /></div>
  <p id="draft-global-status" class="draft-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div id="draft-import-review" class="draft-import-review" hidden><p id="draft-import-description"></p><button type="button" id="draft-import-confirm">确认导入</button><button type="button" id="draft-import-cancel">取消</button></div>
  <noscript><p>启用 JavaScript 后可编辑个人草稿，已发布题解仍可正常阅读。</p></noscript>
</section>
<dialog id="draft-dialog" class="draft-dialog" aria-labelledby="draft-dialog-title" aria-describedby="draft-dialog-help">
  <div class="draft-dialog-header"><div><span class="draft-eyebrow">个人草稿 · 仅当前浏览器</span><h2 id="draft-dialog-title">编辑我的草稿</h2></div><button type="button" id="draft-close" aria-label="关闭草稿编辑器">×</button></div>
  <p id="draft-dialog-help">这里的笔记和代码会自动保存到当前浏览器。可修改下方 Java 示例；代码仅供编辑，不在网页中运行。</p>
  <div id="draft-conflict" class="draft-conflict" hidden><p>另一标签页修改了这道题。请选择要保留的版本；当前输入仍可导出备份。</p><button type="button" id="draft-use-other">使用另一标签页版本</button><button type="button" id="draft-keep-mine">保留我的版本</button></div>
  <label for="draft-notes">我的思路 / 复盘</label><textarea id="draft-notes" rows="5" maxlength="20000" placeholder="记录你的思路、易错点或复习心得……"></textarea>
  <div class="draft-code-label"><label for="draft-java">Java 草稿</label><button type="button" id="draft-copy">复制草稿代码</button></div>
  <textarea id="draft-java" class="draft-java" rows="12" maxlength="100000" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="draft-code-help" placeholder="在这里输入或粘贴你的 Java 代码……"></textarea>
  <p id="draft-code-help">已有示例会预填到这里；编辑后保存为你的个人版本。代码区可用 Tab 缩进，按 Esc 再按 Tab 可离开代码区。</p>
  <div class="draft-dialog-footer"><p id="draft-save-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" id="draft-save-close">保存并关闭</button></div>
</dialog>
